Dream is looking for an Intern, Industrial Leasing (12 month)!
We are always looking for the best and brightest to join our thriving community and the Industrial Leasing team at Dream is looking to hire an Intern, Industrial Leasing for 12 months, starting in January 2026.
The application deadline is Sunday, October 19th. Selected candidates will be invited to attend a one-day assessment centre during the last two weeks of the month.
